  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You establish a permanent arcane zone in a 60-ft cube. Within this zone: nature cannot answer; Commune with Nature and Speak with Animals yield silence; Wild Shape requires a DC 18 Wisdom save per minute; beast companions must save vs. fleeing each round. Druidic magic cast into or out of this zone has its level halved (round down). The zone persists for 24 hours or until countered by a 7th-level Dispel Magic or higher.</p>",
